"\\u{2022} ROC/AUC analysis may be misleading - consider Precision-Recall "
"Curve (PRC) instead. \\u{2022} Sensitivity and specificity remain valid, but "
"predictive values (PPV/NPV) are heavily influenced by prevalence."
msgstr ""
"Analiz edilen örneklemde aşırı prevalans: %%%s (%s). \\u{2022} %s. \\u{2022} "
"ROC/EAA analizi yanıltıcı olabilir - bunun yerine Duyarlılık-Duyarlık "
