"the AUC, the AUC is biased upward, and a marker pointing the wrong way is "
"reported as though it pointed the right way.%s If you know which way the "
"marker should point, set Direction explicitly; a low AUC is then a real "
"finding rather than an artefact of the direction being fitted."
